msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had returned to the thing I had found in the cellar. ⟪k:1⟫Actually, he prowled the "
"mansion’s halls looking more barbaric than ever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就像回到刚见面时的状态一样……⟪k:1⟫不，⟪k:2⟫他比以前更加野蛮地在馆里横行。"

