#: scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97603e0a56712faaa4e8745b517799ae6605ec27b0a7411f06bb163a9f8b062c
#. default-sha256: 239c62f384aec3635fcfca7344975e4218a4f0df5b6c22c5f53fcff87dcc22ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite all the effort he had put into learning to act like a human,⟪k:1⟫he now ripped the "
"velvet curtains off the wall, howling shrilly..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫好不容易才有了一点人的样子，⟪k:1⟫却又变回了野兽。⟪k:2⟫他撕裂了天鹅绒窗帘，⟪k:3⟫不住地呻吟。 "

#: scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f2b1201da1c2632660981623e7ea37f76561d2fa6d034b5a967dd231dda1e91
#. default-sha256: 7ecab4d5059f8be9d08c7243c3a6996ff3d063fdc3237f63cf30e18617a2ba6e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stomping back and forth through the hallways,⟪k:1⟫and ravaging the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在走廊上来回踱步，⟪k:1⟫声音嘈杂，⟪k:2⟫肆无忌惮地破坏庭院。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9b44c3abdd095eddf1dd45d1211088b86ab4df9ba8bfb9b8811900af78c06f1
#. default-sha256: 372332e8f9c0062993556befa6ae3e624a31bba3369be1fdb4b1a914946272ed
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched him intently, though from a distance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆在远处注视着他的暴行。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af22a5be9fcd1df09b27ee2a9799f0963d561ea5c03e34e4dd6c0de5fe619888
#. default-sha256: 29261b14cde0a1ba4bc5206f9d3689e0bab514640e25eda2759abcb74f3ed572
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia was not merely a beast,⟪k:1⟫but an out-of-control, bloodthirsty beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫现在的巴斯蒂亚，不只是一头野兽。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫犹如，⟪k:4⟫无法无天的嗜血狂兽一般。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6d301908b70545a26f178ffd4073861ed134e4c6154efb5104031f8df2d529f
#. default-sha256: 5171e74faacb5e3ff9bbe16b0909a90532e12684b2f11d9dd5859f1a74979948
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just a few days ago, we had been tending the garden together,⟪k:1⟫but that was no longer "
"possible."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不久以前，⟪k:1⟫下仆明明还和他一起拔过杂草。⟪k:2⟫现在甚至连这种事也做不到了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b33208aa20913372ab1eb4e4d834a64e24578ccf3ae732bf4013474d09ebaa41
#. default-sha256: 444e63833e00422252bc255baf52d927b8ec6047c2efbf25275cc750c0f75312
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was quite disappointed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆……⟪k:1⟫悲痛不已。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6827B29D_4F36_4432_9125_0FA63C1350E3
