msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73fcb8ab96c4f5bfb24ea5acd7db0f61b0550fc819c8181f0ecf7b2646f5ad16
#. default-sha256: 7c94dc09c6e28698561ed4b8a370ed846b8ae3b3921f769210131b4111ee9d54
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, Bestia discovered my hiding place. ⟪k:1⟫I had not felt regret in a very long "
"time, but I felt deep regret in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫终于，⟪k:1⟫巴斯蒂亚发现了藏起来的下仆。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫下仆……⟪k:4⟫十分地后悔。⟪k:5⟫这种感觉已经许久"
"不曾有过了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_99E6D8AF_45E1_4FA0_998C_156756077979
