#: scenario2:scenario2_4948A3D4_B1E4_443D_8534_D5A1DBC6F668
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67e9d47074fd6e9bb1c4786c1bf6bf001686805c3150cefd22eb62c8a1cc817d
