msgid "⟪k:0⟫I must satisfy these ⟪k:1⟫urges⟪k:2⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我需要可以满足我的东西啊！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3658F769_8C7F_480E_A8E0_F7FA9C5DE928
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c8b943d18b7917173be23f291dcefd631113d5d8837268301fbac1a98e73edc
#. default-sha256: 770b77542d031272336ff16033aa1aaf0adb194a05892121c6b759f19a40b916
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3658F769_8C7F_480E_A8E0_F7FA9C5DE928"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you saying peace was not enough to sate you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫平静的生活，⟪k:2⟫已经满足不了你了吗？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_74DDD056_1D04_48D8_ABCF_32277ECC01DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7704820c51156e4ffbf045f01a74ff27f888b9a8e76b8e9625d6f820a303592c
#. default-sha256: 57950e28617ba1dfd36bf1d148b6ddf72f2be399863808a326572f370cd6f3e7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_74DDD056_1D04_48D8_ABCF_32277ECC01DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did I mishear you when you asked for peace?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你说过希望拥有平静的生活，⟪k:1⟫难道是下仆听错了吗？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf36cc6e135099dd95f7f3ce76d62b7df70c1f8e1a2faa5c8b31d8fa9cf08b74
#. default-sha256: 0a2967de8d8bae311885813bef86e8adbac6d7a19afe0bca302665d4990084fb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was mistaken...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Asking for peace won’t solve anything!⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我错了……⟪k:2⟫渴望那种东西，⟪k:3⟫什么也解决不了！⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a2f7607b4ba301479d79c28f8a81d473a09c26b1e600ac6fb35bd80175f0e42
#. default-sha256: 0b65096e4f5116ebd5780c3c350768bc28edadeb686534d5d23a229dacbee3bf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blood! Despair! Eyes filled with terror!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫These⟪k:4⟫ are the things I need!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我想要的是……鲜血！⟪k:1⟫绝望！⟪k:2⟫还有恐惧的眼神！！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05cd30fd0192b2865cbc2060e3e54a91658038a600c61394f64ff7f29f0ce51a
#. default-sha256: 97dd3c66916b6c48645e42ffc72186b37ec337622bf298a9867dc7abfa3a311f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I’ve always known it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫从最初开始我就知道的……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2601fa59276cbca715ae99b3b94983beca2cebe1940943d9234dbc007a7640f3
#. default-sha256: cb9bfb37d9de358225dd2d329cb0ecb44865ebc21e3948a56688e2ffe5d1267e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said this mansion fulfills people’s desires!⟪k:1⟫Then... ⟪k:2⟫Then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这座「馆」可以实现我的愿望吧！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那么，⟪k:3⟫那么……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9261b2ebf4f9176cdbb5e321c5bc3c598109abfc013d7fba3bafdc8c2931ee2a
#. default-sha256: eb8f9fa1db0e598a2f00d174b5cf0140e632f5be1a20d598dea78b15d00ec80f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Give me prey!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫No more hares—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫live "
"humans⟪k:12⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫——给我猎物啊！⟪k:5⟫不是野兔，⟪k:6⟫而是活生生的人！！⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03635a7eebfb2b33baae5d7ab4c60a64496e36edc3560533b4607643bf3bf5ab
#. default-sha256: 745390b0a615f24748d89d966973c5006233a38d0b6ad552faddf8bac347c0f3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I ever teach him to speak human language?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆为什么，⟪k:1⟫教给了他人类的语言呢？⟪k:2⟫ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac4b57b9e3525791a2101f425e809306c6b3c03dd51c0fcb36da491824bdda40
#. default-sha256: 4fc34eb050b10e8e506194112abdb00cef0f5ddb9683806a9e2fb276f7c68c0d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Before long, the mansion granted his wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「馆」实现了他的愿望。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ada6b99326c8796b718a128f8e5a7fbc5dd25f357b7aaa4eca5b576ae46618b7
#. default-sha256: 66353761cc69a23e10e5946e36e922a0dc8c43c800a8544f631b8b731d001150
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once a week, a villager or a traveling merchant from somewhere would wander into the forest, "
"ending up at the mansion on the cliff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫从那以后，⟪k:1⟫以每周一次的頻率，⟪k:2⟫在森林里迷路的村民和小镇的市民不断地访问这座悬崖边上的"
"馆。"

