msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫野兽的恶趣味不断变换，变着法地享受扭曲的宴席。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
