msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every week, another atrocious party. He did everything imaginable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫变着花样的残虐盛宴，⟪k:1⟫每周举行一次。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4af4b22cdb7de97fc54fd135a2fe60eaf34a5bd5209700eb81d6b171ca8f1cf5
