msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can only wonder if it actually tasted any good."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………那些人肉真的好吃吗？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e689374029edece0eaabfa2abd857f0734098424b95fc6a557c60c486efd25b
