msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bestia’s peculiar sword was always with him for his twisted banquets of self-gratification. "
"⟪k:1⟫However much blood stained it, it never lost its sheen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫在享用扭曲的愉悦盛宴时，⟪k:1⟫他一定会带着，⟪k:2⟫那把不可思议的刀。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫无论多少次被血染"
"红，⟪k:5⟫那把刀依然寒光闪闪。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5710211f0e636983aceddc5ec55b22e094b0c56d9e3a4b65b1e90bec7a7e09ec
