msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就好像人的血肉，⟪k:1⟫就是它的肥料一样。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
