msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这样看来，⟪k:1⟫还不如无人来访的时代呢。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9332afca9283ee23c4526f154ca340fa89ffca46807a64bf48bd593bf787d5e7
