msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还是说，⟪k:1⟫这是下仆自作自受的报应呢？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
