msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还要、⟪k:1⟫更多……⟪k:2⟫不够啊，⟪k:3⟫这点东西，⟪k:4⟫满足不了我……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fcb716422399e45004a5a8784b53e484dd9c30e10e05b269a83ece1cddcddf7
