msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Bestia still sought to hold more of his perverse parties.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lost villagers were "
"no longer enough to quell his urges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫巴斯蒂亚变本加厉地，⟪k:1⟫渴望着更扭曲的盛宴。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫迷路的村民已经满足不了他了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc67bf17ad45b1cf1861260b01af62bf7026c69bb6d3f3a3f3ab48d11f73745e
