msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, indeed, a genuine beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And in time, this is what he began to wish for:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是的……他是真真正正的野兽。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫渐渐地，他开始这么想了——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009
