msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a hero, someone courageous enough to stand up to him, with whom he could enjoy a "
"battle to the death."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是能与他拼个你死我活的勇者呢。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2f94389cb80597a6841e68ebe2d43a9478f2b9cf92df11a61ac4d642a19f377
