msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a dazzling young nymph to satisfy his other primal urges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or perhaps what "
"he wanted was not human at all,⟪k:3⟫but a demon or a phantom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫还是能满足色欲的美若天仙的女子呢？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫还是说他想要的已经不是人类，⟪k:3⟫而是恶魔或者妖魔"
"之类的东西呢？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6bb0c76728c3285fb4ca9d2f7cd7d4d2b94bf19563503f17eac8b345c4fb529
